// HRESULT status codes returned by LnkSearchMachine ([MS-DLTW] 3.1.4.1). The method
// returns an HRESULT: a value of 0 or any positive value indicates success, and a
// negative value (sign bit set) indicates failure — use StatusIsSuccess to test.
// TRK_E_REFERRAL and TRK_E_POTENTIAL_FILE_FOUND are failure HRESULTs that nonetheless
// carry meaningful [out] parameters (the referred FileLocation / MachineID and a
// candidate FileID respectively), so callers inspect them specifically.
